{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10283270","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10283270","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1028327001:1":{"text":"他の材料は用意してあるわ。気付け薬作りを始めましょう。少し待っててね、こういうのは焦っちゃだめだから。","source_cn":"其他的材料我都备好了，这就开始制作嗅盐。别急，年轻人，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6225EDD29AA083F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028327002:1":{"text":"おばあさん……薬を飲んでしまった私の仲間は大丈夫でしょうか？体に影響とか……","source_cn":"老人家……我的同伴误喝了这药，不会对身体有什么影响吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F06BD1E332BF02A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028327003:1":{"text":"別に問題はないわ。ただ深く眠ってしまうだけよ、ふふっ……不眠症の治療にはもってこいよねぇ。","source_cn":"别的倒也没有什么，就是会睡得很沉，哈哈……治疗失眠的话...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A8F4A44066B0F4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028327004:1":{"text":"冗談がお上手で……","source_cn":"您还真会开玩笑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F60A09D99C4EC97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028327005:1":{"text":"でも、あの薬の効果が人を眠らせるだけなら、なぜ古い石碑には「永遠の若さを保つ」霊薬と書かれているのでしょうか？","source_cn":"可如果它的作用只有让人沉眠，为什么古老的石碑上记载着它...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E00E0B732349149","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028327006:1":{"text":"あはは、「永遠の若さを保つ」というのもあながち間違いじゃないわ。ご先祖様が大げさなだけよ。","source_cn":"哈哈哈，说它能“永葆青春”倒也没错，但那不过是祖先们夸...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB09D58024C7812B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1028327006":{"text":"あはは、「永遠の若さを保つ」というのもあながち間違いじゃないわ。ご先祖様が大げさなだけよ。","source_cn":"哈哈哈，说它能“永葆青春”倒也没错，但那不过是祖先们夸大的说法而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB09D58024C7812B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028327007:1":{"text":"この霊薬は飲んだ者を眠らせると同時に、老化も遅らせるの。だから若さを保てるというわけ。","source_cn":"这种灵药会让人沉睡，衰老速度也跟着变慢，自然永葆青春。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7C8341F009D57A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028327008:1":{"text":"そういうことだったんですね……","source_cn":"原来如此……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0DD4F56D7B4A285","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028327009:1":{"text":"でもあの薬は効果が強すぎて、この気付け薬がないと永遠に眠り続けてしまうのよ。だから毒薬として使われていた時期もあったわ……","source_cn":"但这药太猛烈，如果没有这种嗅盐，甚至真的会让人长眠不醒...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCBDE68DCC5F20C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028327010:1":{"text":"ど、毒薬……","source_cn":"毒、毒药……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD009C5831CCD31F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028327011:1":{"text":"安心して。すぐに起こせば、体に影響はないわ。","source_cn":"放心吧，只要及时唤醒就不会对身体有伤害。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FD3B4731213BD4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028327012:1":{"text":"そういえば、この処方はのちに何代にもわたって改良され、そこから様々な派生品が生まれたの。","source_cn":"话说回来，这个药方，反倒是一代又一代人不断改良，做了点...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47822A52ED361219","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1028327013:1":{"text":"外傷を治療するときに使用する麻酔薬も、この処方を改良してできたものだし……","source_cn":"在治疗外伤时能麻醉伤患的麻醉药剂，就是根据这个药方拓展...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADD9B8180F089110","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1028327014:1":{"text":"それから……「鎮静花茶（ちんせいかちゃ）」は知ってる？精神を落ち着かせる作用があるあのお茶も、この処方を参考にしてるのよ。","source_cn":"还有的话……“安神花茶”，你们知道吧？能放松心神，也是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17EE6ACBF0208FCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_tit